  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 18 March 2026, the proposal as shown on the drawing(s) submitted on 18 March 2026 and numbered Unnumbered Location Plan, Unnumbered Location Plan, Unnumbered Block Plan was not lawful within the meanings of Section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990. \r\nThe development fails to comply with the terms of Class E, Clause(s) E.4 and E.1 (e)(ii) and E.1 (f) of Part 1 of Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) because the maximum height and eaves height would exceed 2.5m and the outbuilding contains primary living accommodation in the form of a toilet and shower and consequently the outbuilding would not be incidental to the enjoyment of the dwelling house.\r\n"
